  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with concat fusion (config_030) underperform RNA-only baselines (0.6315 vs 0.653). This experiment tests weighted fusion instead of concat fusion in a multimodal setup using scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders. It isolates the impact of fusion strategy, which is critical for understanding multimodal interactions. This comparison addresses uncertainty about whether fusion method significantly affects performance, leveraging the best RNA encoder and image encoder from prior experiments."
